function FbaConnectionsPage() { const cards = [['Seller Central · US', 'A3NOVAUS', '订单、库存、财务、FBA 入仓、退货与报告', '已授权', '2 分钟前'], ['SP-API · US Marketplace', 'NA / Amazon.com', 'Orders API · FBA Inventory API · Finances API · Fulfillment Inbound API', '已配置', '5 分钟前'], ['Amazon Ads · US', 'Northstar US Ads', 'Sponsored Products · Sponsored Brands · Sponsored Display', '待复核', '31 分钟前']]; return <div className="page-body fba-page"><PageTitle path="/app/connections" action={<button className="blue-button" onClick={() => Message.info('已打开 Amazon US 授权配置向导')}><IconPlus /> 添加 US 连接</button>} /><FbaScopeBar freshness="2 分钟前" /><div className="notice">正式环境连接 Amazon.com 需要应用审批、LWA、Refresh Token 加密存储和回调域名校验；当前示例不会伪造真实授权成功。</div><div className="fba-connection-grid">{cards.map(row => <div className="panel fba-connection-card" key={row[0]}><div className="panel-head"><div><span className="eyebrow">AMAZON US</span><h3>{row[0]}</h3></div><StatusTag value={row[3]} /></div><p className="id-text">{row[1]}</p><div className="scope-list"><span>US</span><span>FBA</span><span>Reports</span><span>Audit</span></div><div className="connection-detail"><div><small>授权范围</small><b>{row[2]}</b></div><div><small>最近健康检查</small><b>{row[4]}</b></div></div><div className="card-actions"><button className="outline-button" onClick={() => Message.info(`已打开 ${row[0]} 连接诊断`)}>诊断连接</button><button className="link-button" onClick={() => go('/app/sync')}>查看同步任务</button></div></div>)}</div></div> }

function FbaSyncPage() { const jobs = [['SYNC-US-20261019-0194', 'FBA Inventory', 'Sellable / Reserved / Inbound', 'Amazon.com', '10:42:11', '72%', '运行中'], ['SYNC-US-20261019-0193', 'FBA Inbound', 'Shipment / Receiving / Discrepancy', 'Amazon.com', '10:31:08', '100%', '已完成'], ['SYNC-US-20261019-0192', 'FBA Finances', 'Settlement / Fee Preview / Reimbursement', 'Amazon.com', '10:14:37', '41%', '失败'], ['SYNC-US-20261019-0191', 'FBA Returns', 'Customer Return / Disposition', 'Amazon.com', '09:56:20', '100%', '已完成']]; return <div className="page-body fba-page"><PageTitle path="/app/sync" action={<button className="blue-button" onClick={() => Message.success('FBA 同步任务已加入队列')}><IconRefresh /> 创建 FBA 同步</button>} /><FbaScopeBar freshness="任务实时" /><div className="fba-sync-summary"><span><small>队列任务</small><b>18</b></span><span><small>运行中</small><b>2</b></span><span><small>24 小时成功率</small><b>99.2%</b></span><span><small>失败待重试</small><b className="danger-text">1</b></span></div><div className="table-panel"><div className="table-head"><div><h3>Amazon.com FBA 数据同步任务</h3><span className="table-subtitle">任务类型直接对应 SP-API 报告、FBA Inventory、Inbound、Finances 和 Returns 数据域</span></div><span className="status-note">Worker 更新状态 · 失败保留 request ID</span></div><table className="data-table fba-data-table"><thead><tr><th>任务编号</th><th>数据域</th><th>同步内容</th><th>站点</th><th>创建时间</th><th>进度</th><th>状态</th><th>动作</th></tr></thead><tbody>{jobs.map(row => <tr key={row[0]} className={row[6] === '失败' ? 'risk-row' : ''}><td><span className="id-text">{row[0]}</span></td><td><b>{row[1]}</b></td><td>{row[2]}</td><td>{row[3]}</td><td>{row[4]}</td><td><div className="progress-line"><div style={{ width: row[5], background: row[6] === '失败' ? 'var(--red)' : 'var(--brand)' }} /></div><small>{row[5]}</small></td><td><StatusTag value={row[6]} /></td><td><button className="link-button" onClick={() => Message.info(row[6] === '失败' ? '已打开失败原因与重试入口' : '已打开同步任务详情')}>{row[6] === '失败' ? '重试' : '查看'}</button></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div> }

function Workspace({ path }: { path: string }) { let page: ReactNode; if (path === '/app/overview') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="overview" />; else if (path === '/app/orders') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="orders" />; else if (path === '/app/returns') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="returns" />; else if (path === '/app/products') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="products" />; else if (path === '/app/supply-chain') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="inbound" />; else if (path === '/app/inventory') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="inventory" />; else if (path === '/app/warehouse') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="warehouse" />; else if (path === '/app/finance') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="fees" />; else if (path === '/app/connections') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="connections" />; else if (path === '/app/sync') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="sync" />; else if (path === '/app/advertising') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="ads" />; else if (path === '/app/advertising/reports') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="ads-reports" />; else if (path === '/app/reports') page = <FbaOperationsPage module="reports" />; else if (path === '/app/entities') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="entities" />; else if (path === '/app/members') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="members" />; else if (path === '/app/audit') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="audit" />; else if (path === '/app/settings') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="settings" />; else if (path === '/app/profile') page = <ProductionAdminPage kind="profile" />; else page = <FbaOperationsPage module="overview" />; return <Shell path={path}>{page}</Shell> }

export default function App() {
  const [path, setPath] = useState(window.location.pathname || '/')
  useEffect(() => { const listener = () => setPath(window.location.pathname || '/'); window.addEventListener('popstate', listener); return () => window.removeEventListener('popstate', listener) }, [])
  // ERP 当前阶段直接进入工作台；服务端数据接口仍保留真实权限校验，未授权时只显示连接状态。
  if (path === '/site' || path === '/') return <ProductionWebsite page="home" />
  if (path === '/product') return <ProductionWebsite page="product" />
  if (path === '/solutions') return <ProductionWebsite page="solutions" />
  if (path === '/about') return <ProductionWebsite page="about" />
  if (path === '/news') return <ProductionWebsite page="news" />
  if (path === '/resources') return <ProductionWebsite page="resources" />
  if (path === '/contact') return <ProductionWebsite page="contact" />
  if (path === '/login') return <DirectErpEntry />
  return <Workspace path={path.startsWith('/app') ? path : '/app/overview'} />
}
